<title>FRANCE: French business optimism stable - industry survey.</title>
<headline>French business optimism stable - industry survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics institute INSEE gave the following seasonally adjusted data.</p>
<p>A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>					Nov   Oct  Sep  Jul  Jun  May Apr</p>
<p> Recent past output		-8    -8    1   -9   -9  -12 -10</p>
<p> Finished product stocks	 18    16   20   27   30   26  20</p>
<p> Overall orders and demand    -26   -25  -25  -35  -37  -33 -32</p>
<p> Foreign orders and demand     -6   -16  -18  -25  -39  -31 -29</p>
<p> Future output (overall)	-21   -23  -29  -28  -27  -27 -23</p>
<p> Future output (personal)	 4     3    5    3    2    1   9</p>
<p> Future prices (overall)	-26   -31  -26  -22  -19  -16 -11</p>
<p> Future prices (personal)     -14   -11  -14   -9  -19   -9  -5</p>
<p>Recent past output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	     5     9    8  -11   -7    5  -8</p>
<p> Energy			     -73   -75   22  -11   12  -68 -68</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	    -4    -3   -1   -8   -8  -10 -11</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods	     -5   -15   -8  -15  -18  -21 -21</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	-4     2   -6    0   -7  -17  -8</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-38    20   39  -23   20   23  -6</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     3    -2    8    6    3    1  -3</p>
<p>Future output (breakdown)</p>
<p> Agri-food businesses	     7     7   -4  -26  -12   -7  -3</p>
<p> Energy				59    61   -3   12   -7   72  68</p>
<p> Manufacturing output	     1     1    5    3    2   -2   3</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods		0     6   -3   -2    0    0  -7</p>
<p> Industrial capital goods	 3     6    8    7    5   -7   4</p>
<p> Cars and land transport	-31   -30   22    7    7   15  74</p>
<p> Consumer goods		     7    -2    4   -3    2    6   6</p>
